      "type": "home-prescription-support",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Our approach",
        "title": "A doctor-led way to quit nicotine",
        "text": "<p>Nicotine dependence is a medical condition, and it responds to medical treatment. The right therapy at the right dose, with a doctor checking how you are going, gives you far better odds than going it alone.</p><p>Quity brings the pieces together online. An Australian-registered doctor assesses you, a registered pharmacy dispenses TGA-approved nicotine therapy, and it arrives in plain packaging. No waiting room, no subscription and no fee to apply.</p>",
        "highlight": "Make this attempt the one that lasts.",
        "button_primary_label": "Apply for prescription",
        "button_primary_url": "",
        "button_secondary_label": "See how it works",
        "button_secondary_url": "",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/home-1.png",
        "image_alt": "Doctor in a modern clinic",
        "show_stat": true,
        "stat_icon": "doctor",
        "stat_title": "Assessed within one day",
        "stat_sub": "Seven days a week, AHPRA-registered",
        "background": "paper-2",
        "padding_top": 96,
        "padding_bottom": 96
